{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"观念"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"融贯"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"融贯"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><strong>同伦融贯数据</strong> (homotopy-coherent data) 是"},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"表现"}},{"Local":{"url":"无穷范畴","text":"高阶范畴"}},{"Plain":"中的结构时需要提供的越来越高阶的同伦.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"融贯子","text":"融贯子"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}